==Strategy==
This is a Angel/Metal/Alien stage, although in reality you can ignore the Aliens given that it's just Shibalien and one Axoloty. The real main threat of this stage is the Rajakong, who you are given pretty little time to kill before Sir Metal Seal arrives, and once those two join forces you have basically lost. Of course, the main solution here is to kill Rajakong as fast as you can. After you kill all the stuff at the start, make sure to send out [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] as soon as you can to ensure that his recharge goes off cooldown when you need him later. Once Bahamut hits the base, he should be able to get off quite a few hits on Rajakong before dying. At this point, stall him with [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] near the middle of the stage to bait out the Axoloty who spawns on a delay. After that, lure Rajakong to the Cat Base and kill him fast with units like Ramen to wall, [[Ancient Egg: N106 (Rare Cat)|Mushroom Cat]] as your main source of DPS and a Talented [[Nymph Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fiend Cat]] to deal with the Chibinel in the back. Alongside a bunch of Research [[Cat Combo]]s, this combination should be able to stall the Rajakong until your Bahamut is off cooldown, who you should use alongside a well timed [[Ototo Corps#Thunderbolt|Thunderbolt]] to get off more damage. In most situations, Sir Metal Seal will arrive and start blocking your Mushrooms from connecting onto Rajakong. If that happens, you now need to switch towards spamming your Ramen alongside your LD attackers like Fiend, [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Volley Cat (Rare Cat)|Curry Cat]]. With these units, it shouldn't be much of a struggle to deal with the last bit of Rajakong's health and the Sir Metal Seal, alongside the occasional Gabriel or Angelic Gory.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*Sir Metal Seal is a non-issue with Curry, so the best Ubers here are units for Rajakong. Examples include [[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Jizo's Mega-Castle]], [[Mighty Deth-Troy-R (Uber Rare Cat)|Obliterator Diabolosa]], [[Dynasaurus Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Dynasaurus Cat]] and [[Kachi-Kachi (Uber Rare Cat)|Kachiyama Assault Brigade]].

